      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Bir anda ortam sessizle\u015Fir.\n\n\xC7\xFCnk\xFC o sade vazo, \xE7i\xE7e\u011Fi
    \xF6yle g\xFCzel g\xF6sterir ki di\u011Fer t\xFCm s\xFCsl\xFC vazolar\u0131n
    g\xF6steri\u015Fi anlams\u0131z kal\u0131r. J\xFCri ba\u015Fkan\u0131 g\xFCl\xFCmser
    ve sonucu a\xE7\u0131klar: Kazanan, en pahal\u0131 olan de\u011Fil\u2026 \u0130\xE7indekini
    en g\xFCzel \u015Fekilde ortaya \xE7\u0131karan vazodur.\n\nO g\xFCn herkes \u015Funu
    anlar: De\u011Fer, d\u0131\u015F g\xF6r\xFCn\xFC\u015Fte de\u011Fil; neye yer
    a\xE7t\u0131\u011F\u0131nda ve onu nas\u0131l ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
    gizlidir."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
